🔌 GREEN CIRCUIT – Wiring / Connections (with MQ135)
🧠 ESP32 Pin Connections
Component	Pin on Sensor	ESP32 Pin
| Component                         | Pin on Sensor | ESP32 Pin          |
| --------------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------ |
| **Soil Moisture Sensor (Analog)   | AO            | GPIO **34**        |
|                                   | VCC           | **3.3V**           |
|                                   | GND           | **GND**            |
| **Rain Sensor (Analog)            | AO            | GPIO **35**        |
|                                   | VCC           | **3.3V**           |
|                                   | GND           | **GND**            |
| **DHT11 Sensor                    | DATA          | GPIO **4**         |
|                                   | VCC           | **3.3V**           |
|                                   | GND           | **GND**            |
| **MQ135 Gas Sensor                | AO            | GPIO **32**        |
|                                   | VCC           | **5V**             |
|                                   | GND           | **GND**            |
| **OLED Display (0.96” I2C)        | SDA           | GPIO **21**        |
|                                   | SCL           | GPIO **22**        |
|                                   | VCC           | **3.3V**           |
|                                   | GND           | **GND**            |
| **Relay Module                    | IN            | GPIO **26**        |
|                                   | VCC           | **5V**             |
|                                   | GND           | **GND**            |
| **Water Pump                      | +             | Relay **NO**       |
|                                   | −             | External Power GND |
